<title>USA: Wellco Q4 earnings results $0.96 vs $0.26.</title>
<headline>Wellco Q4 earnings results $0.96 vs $0.26.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNESVILLE, N.C. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(000's ommitted, except per share amounts and number of shares)</p>
<p>				     Fiscal Year	 Fiscal Three</p>
<p>					  Ended	    Months Ended</p>
<p>				   Jun 29,   Jul 1,  Jun 29,   Jul 1,</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Revenues			$19,968  $18,003  $ 5,450  $ 3,795</p>
<p>Income of Affiliate,</p>
<p>Stock Repurchase Charge</p>
<p>  and Income Taxes	     2,068    1,143	436	102</p>
<p>Equity in (Loss) Income</p>
<p>  of Affiliate		   (601)	 69		    41</p>
<p> Stock Repurchase Charge     (110)</p>
<p> Income Before Income Taxes  1,357    1,212	436	143</p>
<p>Provision for Income Taxes</p>
<p>  (Benefit)			  366	243	 76     (87)</p>
<p> Net Income			  991	969	360	230</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share	   1.58     1.10     0.96     0.26</p>
<p> Avg shr			 628,216  884,806  374,382  884,806</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for Q4 and year-end increased in part after company repurchased 510,424 of its common shares on December 29, resulting in a reduction in number of shares outstanding.</p>
<p>This year's income also includes a $110,000 stock repurchase charge.</p>
</text>
